fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"d3d12/GstD3D12MemoryCopy.html#GstD3D12MemoryCopy:use-staging-memory","fragment":"\n\tuse-staging-memory\n\nUse GPU-visible staging memory for upload/download operations\ninstead of system memory\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\ttrue\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});